graph TD
  U[User<br/>Browser] -->|GET /es/scanner| MW[middleware.ts<br/>Auth check + i18n<br/>next-intl]
  MW -->|Unauthenticated| LoginPage[/locale/login]
  MW -->|Authenticated| UI[Next.js Scanner Page<br/>i18n: ES / EN]

  UI -->|GET /api/scanner| RL1[Rate Limiter<br/>30 req/min per IP]
  UI -->|GET /api/markets| RL2[Rate Limiter<br/>60 req/min per IP]

  RL1 -->|429 Too Many Requests| UI
  RL2 -->|429 Too Many Requests| UI

  RL1 --> Valid[Zod Validation<br/>scannerQuerySchema]
  RL2 --> Markets[Markets Config<br/>ibex35 / dax40 / ftse_mib40]

  Valid --> Cache[MemoryCache<br/>6h TTL<br/>⚠ per-instance in serverless]
  Cache -->|cache hit| Results
  Cache -->|cache miss| UC[runScanner<br/>use case]

  UC --> PF{Provider Factory<br/>source param}
  PF -->|yahoo| YF[Yahoo Finance API<br/>yahoo-finance2]
  PF -->|stooq| FB[FallbackProvider<br/>Stooq CSV → Yahoo]
  PF -->|alphavantage| AV[Alpha Vantage API<br/>⚠ Requires paid API key]

  YF --> ATH[computeAth<br/>ath_real / ath_52w]
  FB --> ATH
  AV -->|No key → HTTP 422| UC

  ATH --> Results[ScannerResult]
  Results --> UI

  UI -->|select row| TV[TradingView Widget<br/>sanitizeSymbol XSS guard]
  UI -->|runtime error| ErrPage[error.tsx<br/>Global error boundary]
  UI -->|route not found| NotFound[not-found.tsx<br/>404 page]
  UI -->|loading| Loading[scanner/loading.tsx<br/>Skeleton UI]

  subgraph Firebase Auth
    LoginPage --> FB_AUTH[Firebase Auth SDK]
    FB_AUTH -->|token| Cookie[auth-session cookie]
    Cookie --> MW
  end

  style YF fill:#90EE90
  style FB fill:#90EE90
  style AV fill:#FFD700
  style ATH fill:#87CEEB
  style Cache fill:#DDA0DD
  style ErrPage fill:#FFB6C1
  style NotFound fill:#FFB6C1
  style RL1 fill:#FFA07A
  style RL2 fill:#FFA07A
